   "dataset": null,
   "no_dataset_reason": "I searched for a public dataset with paired left and right bovid horn 3D geometry, meaning scans, centerlines or landmark curves. I found none that I could open and verify. The closest items were not usable. The Imperial College MRes dissertation on 3D horn variation in Bovidae is access-restricted. The Harary and Tal horn scans are supplementary material to a paper and have no dataset landing page. The cattle, goat and mouflon asymmetry studies report only horn length and circumference in article tables, with no deposited raw data. The Dryad mule deer record covers antlers, not horns. I fetched no landing page with WebFetch, so I name no dataset rather than risk an unverified identifier. A future test could use MorphoSource bovid skull scans, but I did not identify a specific verified project.",
